{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32144","headline":"谢公墅歌 · 温庭筠","name":"谢公墅歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"朱雀航南绕香陌，谢郎东墅连春碧。\n鸠眠高柳日方融，绮榭飘颻紫庭客。\n文楸方罫花参差，心阵未成星满池。\n四座无喧梧竹静，金蝉玉柄俱持颐。\n对局含情见千里，都城已得长虵尾。\n江南王气系疎襟，未许苻坚过淮水。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"温庭筠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32144.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32144","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}